  ('Mathematics', 'OCR B', 'alevel', '1.1', 'Proof', 'Prove that the sum of two odd numbers is even.', 'Let the odd numbers be 2m + 1 and 2n + 1. Their sum is 2m + 2n + 2 = 2(m + n + 1), which is even.', 3),
